t.md:191:carrier of body version 3 (`yin.vm.ucf-transport-tuples.md` as amended by\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:194:conflict is resolved in its favour without further amendment. **Not\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:275:body's own version and is what this amendment raises. The key of the\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:278::yin.k/version 0}`: the amendment changes handoff data and composition\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:382:amendment. What survives of this section for `\"v4\"` is the identity\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:857:`:yin.k/registers R` of the version-2 amendment is the `act`/`tail` state\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1229:once per slice, not per closure, under the module-store amendment of\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1411:cursor cell becomes a fresh store cursor entry -- is amended by the resource\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1480:#### 7.6.1a `:yin.k/trees`: the source association (amendment 2026-10-11)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1591:amended by the linker's resource split (`yin.vm.linker.md` 7.3): stream\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1715:## §7.7 Ownership arbitration — custody as a lease over datoms (blocker 4)\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1717:### 7.7.1 The race, named\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1732:### 7.7.2 Custody facts, and their dispatch keys\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1811:### 7.7.3 The authority: what the grantor possesses\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:1857:### 7.7.4 The exporting state: fencing the source before publication\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2039:### 7.7.5 Fencing effects: epochs, operation ids, and what exactly-once costs\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2128:### 7.7.6 Successors and chains\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2155:### 7.7.7 Restart\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2193:### 7.7.8 Fenced custody, version 1: sequence, envelope, epoch binding\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2326:amendment enrolls one effect kind, `:yin.k/append`, a stream append;\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2682:amendment adds no `:yin.k/status` value; the set stays closed.\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2803:## §7.10 Invariant compliance\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2823:## §7.11 Acceptance blockers for the implementation phase\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2993:### 7.11.1 Blocker-closure acceptance matrix\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:2999:must consume the UCF table amendments in linker section 11 item 12 before\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3192:**Fenced custody, version 1 (7.2.1, 7.4.3, 7.7.8, 7.9; amendment r5).**\ndocs/design/yin.vm.universal-continuation-format.md:3328:Not claimed by this amendment, and still owed by the ownership row:\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
